# One UI, stacked packages (locked)

Tarteeb: **Basic → Pro → Business → Business Pro**. Har step pe feature + website saath. Alag theme / alag app nahi.

| Plan | Rail on `anexomail.com` |
|---|---|
| **Basic** | Dashboard · Mail · People · Calendar |
| **Pro** | + Work + CRM (own book) |
| **Business** | + Org + Chat + CRM Shared work |
| **Business Pro** | Business + CRM Activity ledger |

**UI same** — AppShell, mail three-panel, tokens, type. Package sirf cheezein **add** karta hai.

**`ai.anexomail.com`:** wahi UI. Farq sirf AI features + **LEO**. Naya layout / naya CRM / naya mail app **banned**.

- Wall on URL for locked surfaces (`PlanSurfaceGate`). Blank nahi.
- LEO mail host pe nahi. Founder/Speed/Admin = founder host.
- `plans.ts` no-touch. Naya rail item tabhi jab us package ki card pe ho.
